Thus we need to assemble transport leg (any of the assemble actions) and authorize loading.

We have transport_leg_available initially. After assembling, it becomes not available.

We need to decide which assemble action fits the preconditions given our state after locking etc.

We will have origin_availability_locked and origin_availability_confirmed after lock. Destination similarly.

